WEBVTT

00:42.830 --> 00:43.960
Shadow...

00:49.750 --> 00:51.830
That is too late

00:51.830 --> 00:54.750
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

00:54.750 --> 00:56.880
That is to say...

00:59.830 --> 01:06.080
The first move chooses an unknown future
Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future<b></b>

01:06.080 --> 01:08.420
How it will be
Sono arisama<b></b>

01:08.750 --> 01:09.880
This way

01:09.880 --> 01:16.130
The last move decides the world's answer
Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer<b></b>

01:16.130 --> 01:18.750
A single winner
Hitori no winner<b></b>

01:18.750 --> 01:20.130
It's me

01:20.380 --> 01:22.670
These eyes have seen it
Kono me wa misueta<b></b>

01:24.170 --> 01:29.750
The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o<b></b>

01:31.040 --> 01:34.830
It's all a game to control the board
Subete wa banjou shihai suru game<b></b>

01:34.830 --> 01:37.330
A battle of thought
Shikou no tousou<b></b>

01:37.500 --> 01:39.880
I disguise even my mistakes
Mistake sae mo gisou shite<b></b>

01:39.880 --> 01:42.460
And even checkmate is a preparatory move
Checkmate made fuseki toshite<b></b>

01:42.460 --> 01:44.920
A game to take each other's king
King o ubaiau game<b></b>

01:44.920 --> 01:47.380
Ideology and desire
Shisou to yokubou<b></b>

01:47.670 --> 01:50.040
A bad move to not let one chance get away
One chance minogasanu akushu<b></b>

01:50.040 --> 01:52.710
The last chance will cinch it
Last chance kanarazu shitomeru<b></b>

01:52.960 --> 01:54.960
That is too late

01:54.960 --> 01:57.880
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:57.880 --> 02:00.040
That is to say

02:00.040 --> 02:05.000
Total victory is in my hands
Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni<b></b>

02:10.290 --> 02:13.080
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

02:14.080 --> 02:19.000
<b>#07 Something Precious</b>

02:26.830 --> 02:28.670
This bank, too?

02:29.080 --> 02:31.750
I heard those guys have been
going around the branch offices

02:31.750 --> 02:33.750
redeeming their money for gold all day.

02:36.170 --> 02:39.040
"Due to unforeseen circumstances,
this branch is temporarily closed"?

02:39.460 --> 02:40.920
How can you do that to us?!

02:40.920 --> 02:43.330
So the rumors were really true...

02:43.330 --> 02:46.500
These banknotes are just
worthless scraps of paper now!

02:49.040 --> 02:51.750
You still haven't found out where
the counterfeit bills are coming from?

02:51.750 --> 02:55.210
No, we haven't pinpointed
the factory that's printing them.

02:55.210 --> 02:58.000
But we have figured out who's behind it!

02:58.000 --> 02:59.460
It's Yukime!

02:59.830 --> 03:02.830
That she-fox that rules the White Tower in Lawless City!

03:02.830 --> 03:05.170
A carriage from the Snow Fox Corporation

03:05.170 --> 03:08.420
was used to transport the gold coins
that had been exchanged.

03:08.420 --> 03:12.210
And the Snow Fox Corporation happens to be
the public face of the White Tower.

03:12.210 --> 03:13.460
<i>It's a coincidence.
</i>And the route that they used to transport the money<b></b>

03:13.460 --> 03:15.290
<i>No, I knew that she had stooped to prostitution.
</i>And the route that they used to transport the money<b></b>

03:15.290 --> 03:17.290
<i>No, I knew that she had stooped to prostitution.
</i>is an exact match for the counterfeit bill routes<b></b>

03:17.290 --> 03:18.380
<i>No, I knew that she had stooped to prostitution.
</i>we've been investigating.<b></b>

03:19.540 --> 03:20.750
Huh?!

03:21.790 --> 03:24.420
Wh-what is the matter, sir?

03:41.960 --> 03:42.960
Stop.

03:42.960 --> 03:43.960
Sir?

03:44.460 --> 03:46.880
Stop the carriage.

03:57.790 --> 04:01.670
He has ascended to heights that only he can attain.

04:03.500 --> 04:05.380
He doesn't need me anymore.

04:07.880 --> 04:10.880
The fall of the Major Corporate Alliance is unstoppable.

04:11.290 --> 04:15.830
They've forced closure of all their storefronts,
bringing the citizens' unrest to its peak.

04:15.830 --> 04:19.000
Riots are breaking out at each of their bank branches.

04:19.290 --> 04:21.380
Customers are bearing down on our bank, as well.

04:21.380 --> 04:24.420
They are demanding to exchange their money,
and we're struggling to control the situation.

04:24.960 --> 04:26.210
Can we weather the storm?

04:26.500 --> 04:28.130
If things carry on like this,

04:28.130 --> 04:31.540
it will only be a few days before
our bank vault is empty.

04:31.750 --> 04:35.380
Even with all of our domestic and
foreign assets combined,

04:35.380 --> 04:38.000
we won't survive a credit collapse.

04:38.630 --> 04:39.830
I see.

04:40.790 --> 04:42.420
But it's all right!

04:42.420 --> 04:46.000
If we just had something that we could provide to
give the marketplace a sense of security,

04:46.000 --> 04:48.420
surely we can put a stop to this catastrophe!

04:48.750 --> 04:50.290
For example... I know!

04:50.290 --> 04:52.670
We could show them that we have
giant stacks of gold coins!

04:52.670 --> 04:53.880
Forget it.

04:54.670 --> 04:56.630
It doesn't matter anymore.

04:58.000 --> 05:00.580
He's the one that put the counterfeit bills in circulation.

05:01.040 --> 05:03.580
He's the one who caused the credit collapse.

05:04.460 --> 05:06.460
This is what he wanted.

05:07.290 --> 05:09.250
He has forsaken us.

05:09.250 --> 05:12.000
No! No, he would never do that!

05:12.000 --> 05:14.670
Lord Shadow would never abandon us!

05:15.210 --> 05:18.580
We failed to live up to his expectations.

05:19.750 --> 05:21.420
And this is the result.

05:22.540 --> 05:26.580
He gave us the best environment,
the best of knowledge...

05:26.960 --> 05:29.880
But we failed to reach his level.

05:30.670 --> 05:34.460
He has washed his hands of our incompetence.

05:35.210 --> 05:36.880
No...

05:44.330 --> 05:49.330
If it is what you wish, I will give you my life.

05:50.210 --> 05:53.040
That was my promise.

05:54.170 --> 05:55.380
Excuse me.

06:02.080 --> 06:03.670
We've found solid evidence.

06:03.670 --> 06:06.040
We now have no doubt that
the man known as Gettan

06:06.040 --> 06:08.330
is leading an operation for the Cult of Diablos.

06:08.830 --> 06:11.170
He had been conspiring to circulate counterfeit bills

06:11.170 --> 06:13.880
in a plot to bankrupt the Mitsugoshi Corporation.

06:15.500 --> 06:17.670
Then he's prepared to destroy himself.

06:18.130 --> 06:20.540
Even without our connection to Shadow Garden,

06:20.540 --> 06:24.670
they still saw Mitsugoshi as that powerful a threat.

06:25.420 --> 06:28.750
While we were busy fighting economic warfare,

06:28.750 --> 06:31.460
Lord Shadow saw the truth, and went alone to...

06:31.460 --> 06:32.960
<i>Saw the truth?
</i>No wonder he forsook us.<b></b>

06:33.380 --> 06:35.880
He knew about the counterfeit bills...

06:36.750 --> 06:40.170
The Cult had been plotting to put
counterfeit bills into circulation.

06:40.880 --> 06:42.290
Yes, but...

06:42.290 --> 06:45.580
But the Cult hasn't begun to circulate
any false banknotes.

06:46.500 --> 06:49.330
B-but there are definitely counterfeits going-

06:51.420 --> 06:54.290
No, the bills currently in circulation are...

06:54.290 --> 06:55.500
Yes...

06:55.670 --> 06:58.080
Shadow created this entire scenario.

06:58.380 --> 07:00.500
He changed his name, cut us off,

07:00.500 --> 07:04.130
then he started circulating counterfeit bills
before the Cult could execute their plan.

07:04.750 --> 07:05.960
But to what end?

07:05.960 --> 07:07.170
Lady Alpha!

07:08.040 --> 07:09.330
This is huge!

07:09.330 --> 07:13.210
We just finished deciphering the coded message
Lord Shadow gave me!

07:13.670 --> 07:16.000
Eta cracked the code!
Here's what it says!

07:23.000 --> 07:24.210
Lady Alpha?

07:25.080 --> 07:26.290
He...

07:27.540 --> 07:29.710
He hasn't abandoned us after all.

07:31.830 --> 07:34.790
"I'm sorry, but I have decided to turn traitor."

07:35.290 --> 07:36.920
"I have a plan...

07:36.920 --> 07:38.460
...to achieve it I must...
and to achieve it I must...<b></b>

07:38.460 --> 07:41.130
forsake my former name, and print counterfeit bills
with the help of an accomplice.

07:41.580 --> 07:43.080
The gold coins we have recovered

07:43.080 --> 07:46.580
are being stored in the facility where you all
once helped me rescue my sister.

07:46.920 --> 07:49.130
I know you may resent me for it,

07:49.130 --> 07:52.750
but I believe this choice was for the best.
...I believe this choice was for the best."<b></b>

07:53.540 --> 07:57.380
Lord Shadow did all of this for us.

07:57.790 --> 07:59.960
This is the world as he sees it.

08:00.290 --> 08:03.170
He foresaw everything and chose the best option.

08:03.420 --> 08:04.790
We should have known.

08:05.460 --> 08:08.630
He identified the Cult's plot before anyone else,

08:08.630 --> 08:10.630
and used it against them.

08:11.080 --> 08:14.210
By circulating counterfeit bills
before the Cult made their move,

08:14.210 --> 08:16.790
he made it possible to collect a tremendous fortune.

08:17.330 --> 08:21.630
With those funds, Mitsugoshi will be able
to survive the credit collapse.

08:22.000 --> 08:26.250
And now, the Cult no longer has the MCA on their side;
they are the only losers in this war.

08:26.250 --> 08:28.670
The Cult tangled with the wrong man.

08:28.670 --> 08:30.960
This is all possible only because Lord Shadow

08:30.960 --> 08:33.630
has a deeper understanding of credit creation
than anyone in the world.

08:33.630 --> 08:35.790
He boldly and efficiently collected funds,

08:35.790 --> 08:38.710
all with a full knowledge of the risks of credit collapse.

08:38.710 --> 08:39.960
I could learn from this.

08:40.250 --> 08:44.000
He hid his identity in order
to remove his connection to us.

08:44.000 --> 08:48.290
To hide the fact that the counterfeit bills,
Mitsugoshi, and Shadow Garden are all tied together!

08:48.290 --> 08:52.250
Lord Shadow deliberately built his counterfeit
printing operation in a place we're familiar with

08:52.250 --> 08:54.580
and even marked the location of his vault!

08:54.580 --> 08:57.790
"In fooling your enemy, first deceive your allies!"
That's what he was doing!

08:58.290 --> 09:00.880
Now all that's left is for us to collect the gold.

09:00.880 --> 09:04.790
An elaborate plan based on intricate
and advanced calculations...

09:04.790 --> 09:06.670
I'd expect nothing less from Lord Shadow!

09:07.040 --> 09:09.040
"Once it's all over, then you'll understand."

09:09.040 --> 09:11.170
"You'll know that this was the best choice."

09:11.750 --> 09:13.830
It's exactly as he said.

09:14.170 --> 09:16.670
But then, what about Delta?

09:16.670 --> 09:18.000
I wouldn't worry.

09:21.830 --> 09:23.080
Delta...

09:27.130 --> 09:28.130
Delta!

09:28.130 --> 09:29.420
Oh! You had me so worried!

09:30.750 --> 09:35.290
Delta went on a hush-hush secret mission, and, um...

09:35.710 --> 09:36.920
We know.

09:36.920 --> 09:39.080
Lord Shadow asked you to do something for him.

09:39.210 --> 09:41.380
Delta went to the Black Jugga and...

09:41.380 --> 09:42.580
Oh, oops.

09:42.580 --> 09:45.130
It's a hush-hush secret mission, so I can't tell you.

09:45.500 --> 09:48.170
Delta, learn how to use words properly.

09:48.790 --> 09:51.080
"Hush-hush secret" is redundant.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.960
What? But Boss said-

09:53.630 --> 09:55.580
You know he would never talk like that.

09:57.500 --> 09:59.880
But I'm glad to see you're all right.

10:09.000 --> 10:13.290
<i>I am very busy running around beating up
the bad guys who are after my money-</i>

10:13.290 --> 10:16.380
<i>I mean, trying to find the secret
of the counterfeit bills.</i>

10:16.790 --> 10:19.750
<i>But today is one day where it doesn't bother me
in the least to be the only man on staff,</i>

10:19.750 --> 10:20.880
<i>or to be doing unpaid overtime.</i>

10:20.880 --> 10:24.080
<i>Because Yukime said she's not
doing this for the money.</i>

10:24.540 --> 10:27.920
<i>And that means,
I get to keep all the dough for myself!</i>

10:28.710 --> 10:30.880
<i>Yukime will probably be back soon.</i>

10:30.880 --> 10:33.250
<i>Now I just need to look down on the city
from somewhere up high,</i>

10:33.250 --> 10:36.250
<i>mutter something that sounds significant,
and this job is done.</i>

10:37.040 --> 10:38.630
The collapse has begun.

10:39.170 --> 10:41.130
It's all according to plan.

10:48.330 --> 10:49.540
Mr. Smith!

10:49.540 --> 10:50.750
Mr. John Smith!

10:50.880 --> 10:51.710
It would take time to carry this enormous sum out of here.

10:51.710 --> 10:53.380
We've lost contact with Lady Yukime!
It would take time to carry this enormous sum out of here.<b></b>

10:53.380 --> 10:55.380
We're afraid Gettan has-
Unless one is quite skilled, it could not be taken far before-<b></b>

10:57.420 --> 10:59.080
Mr. Smith?

11:00.000 --> 11:01.210
Gettan...

11:01.830 --> 11:03.170
Gettan, eh?

11:13.250 --> 11:15.580
Of course, Gettan.

11:15.960 --> 11:18.000
I see what happened here.

11:19.420 --> 11:21.210
Th-there's not a single gold coin left.

11:21.540 --> 11:23.330
No, you don't think Gettan...

11:24.330 --> 11:26.920
But it seems a little soon for that...

11:29.790 --> 11:31.000
Gettan...

11:31.380 --> 11:34.330
You've tried to get your grubby hands on
something very precious to me.

11:34.880 --> 11:37.080
But you will give it back.

11:37.880 --> 11:39.500
I will see to that!

11:59.750 --> 12:03.830
The legendary golden-haired, nine-tailed fox...

12:04.750 --> 12:07.290
If I had had that power,

12:07.880 --> 12:12.210
no one would have taken from me,
or from any of us!

12:12.210 --> 12:17.330
And now you're using that power for no reason
but to take from me, Yukime?!

12:19.210 --> 12:21.170
This is the end.
It is over.

12:21.170 --> 12:22.500
Not yet!

12:22.500 --> 12:24.830
If I only had the money you took from me,

12:24.830 --> 12:26.420
I could still make this work!

12:26.420 --> 12:29.250
If I had the money...
If I had the power...

12:30.500 --> 12:34.750
Something changed you,
and I do not know what that something is.

12:35.710 --> 12:39.210
But although you are the one who slew my mother,

12:39.540 --> 12:44.040
the truth remains that you once
saved my village, and my life.

12:45.130 --> 12:46.920
I want to believe that, somewhere inside you,

12:46.920 --> 12:49.130
there yet remains the man I knew that day.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.960
Goodbye, Gettan.

12:58.580 --> 13:00.000
Don't you mock me...

13:00.750 --> 13:03.670
Don't you dare mock me!

13:11.580 --> 13:13.380
Gettan...

13:13.790 --> 13:17.960
I should have killed you too, that day.

13:24.380 --> 13:27.710
If I don't take from them, they'll take from me.

13:28.130 --> 13:29.880
Yukime!

13:37.710 --> 13:38.920
Gettan...

13:42.330 --> 13:43.630
Mr. Smith?

13:44.670 --> 13:45.920
I see...

13:46.670 --> 13:48.750
So, you're John Smith.

13:49.380 --> 13:52.630
To think you would be so foolish as to
voluntarily come out where I can kill you.

13:53.130 --> 13:54.330
Gettan...

13:58.580 --> 13:59.830
I am only here...

14:00.420 --> 14:02.880
...to retrieve something very precious to me.

14:07.380 --> 14:09.170
You're the one who stole from me.

14:10.170 --> 14:11.750
I know you're the one who stole from me!

14:11.750 --> 14:13.630
Enough talk!

14:14.080 --> 14:17.580
As if you didn't steal from me yourself!

14:17.880 --> 14:20.630
I am only here to retrieve something
very precious to me.

14:20.630 --> 14:23.580
You think you can feign innocence, John Smith!?

14:29.670 --> 14:32.830
It would have been just as well for him
to simply abandon me, yet he...

14:33.460 --> 14:35.040
"Something very precious."

14:36.250 --> 14:38.540
He is such a compassionate man.

14:41.170 --> 14:43.750
Truly, so compassionate.

14:50.290 --> 14:51.500
Gettan?

14:52.630 --> 14:54.250
Yukime...

14:55.290 --> 14:56.540
Talk.

14:57.250 --> 15:00.330
Surely you have something to say.

15:04.460 --> 15:06.710
I have nothing to say!

15:06.710 --> 15:08.130
Nothing!

15:20.420 --> 15:21.630
Talk.

15:21.630 --> 15:24.130
Surely you have something to say.

15:24.630 --> 15:26.920
I have nothing to-

15:28.000 --> 15:29.330
Talk.

15:29.330 --> 15:31.580
Surely you have something to say.

15:32.420 --> 15:34.960
I have... nothing...

15:35.790 --> 15:37.000
Talk.

15:37.330 --> 15:38.830
Say what you have to say.

15:40.130 --> 15:41.130
Say it.

15:41.460 --> 15:42.460
Say it.

15:42.790 --> 15:43.790
Say it.

15:44.330 --> 15:45.330
Say it.

15:45.960 --> 15:46.960
Say it.

15:47.420 --> 15:48.420
Say it.

15:48.920 --> 15:49.920
Say it.

15:53.000 --> 15:56.420
That obscene level of power...

15:56.420 --> 15:58.580
It's just like...

15:58.580 --> 16:02.750
the monster who took the light from my eyes.

16:03.380 --> 16:06.750
If only I had had that power...

16:07.330 --> 16:12.080
maybe something would have been different.

16:12.750 --> 16:16.630
I really didn't want to let them take from me...

16:18.080 --> 16:20.540
I wanted to protect...

16:23.380 --> 16:25.710
I leave you...

16:27.210 --> 16:28.920
my precious...

16:30.380 --> 16:33.000
Be... near t... her...

16:34.540 --> 16:37.250
...n... jus... know... tha...

16:43.960 --> 16:46.790
Very well, your treasure is in good hands.

16:56.920 --> 16:58.290
Mr. Smith...

17:16.130 --> 17:17.460
It was you...

17:18.960 --> 17:20.460
You were the one who...

17:24.920 --> 17:28.210
Thank you, John Smith!

17:32.790 --> 17:35.170
He said it was buried beneath the snow, right?

17:44.250 --> 17:45.500
Empty.

17:45.500 --> 17:47.670
Oh, no, this is just...

17:47.670 --> 17:48.880
Arrest him.

17:48.880 --> 17:51.170
No, wait! This must be some kind of-

17:51.170 --> 17:52.380
Garter Kikuchi.

17:52.540 --> 17:54.830
You are under arrest for disrupting the marketplace,

17:54.830 --> 17:57.540
taking offensive action against the
royal distribution network, and...

17:59.420 --> 18:00.630
Lady Yukime!

18:00.630 --> 18:01.880
We're so glad you're all right!

18:01.880 --> 18:03.540
I apologize for worrying you.

18:03.790 --> 18:05.710
Mr. Smith ran out as soon as we told him.

18:06.210 --> 18:08.290
Speaking of which, where is he?

18:08.750 --> 18:10.130
I believe...

18:10.500 --> 18:13.170
He has gone to perform a proper burial.

18:14.330 --> 18:17.040
He truly is such a compassionate man.

18:20.750 --> 18:21.960
But how...

18:22.500 --> 18:24.290
Yukime of the White Tower...

18:24.750 --> 18:27.460
I am Alpha.
I work for Shadow Garden.

18:27.460 --> 18:30.670
From your reaction, I see he hasn't yet told you.

18:31.000 --> 18:33.630
You were his accomplice, as well as...

18:33.830 --> 18:35.540
the love of Gettan's life.

18:35.920 --> 18:37.210
This is for you.

18:39.080 --> 18:41.330
The Major Corporate Alliance is destroyed.

18:41.630 --> 18:46.670
We have recovered what needed to be recovered
before the royal investigation began.

18:46.880 --> 18:49.710
We found that in Gettan's chambers.

18:49.960 --> 18:52.290
The writing was twisted and difficult to read,

18:52.290 --> 18:53.210
but I believe it is addressed to you.

18:53.210 --> 18:54.580
His handwriting is sloppy.
but I believe it is addressed to you.<b></b>

18:54.960 --> 18:58.710
But his poor eyesight is not necessarily
the only reason for that.

18:59.290 --> 19:02.250
He was never the type of man
who could sit comfortably at a desk.

19:02.630 --> 19:06.380
For important correspondence,
he often dictated to me, and I wrote the letters.

19:07.460 --> 19:08.920
The Cult of Diablos...

19:09.290 --> 19:12.210
That is the organization that led Gettan astray.

19:12.790 --> 19:13.830
Cult?

19:13.830 --> 19:15.920
They take advantage of a person's weakness,

19:15.920 --> 19:18.420
narrow that person's vision,
and lure them into darkness.

19:19.000 --> 19:21.130
We are fighting to stop them.

19:21.420 --> 19:22.750
He is, too, of course.

19:22.750 --> 19:24.040
"He"?

19:24.040 --> 19:26.420
John Smith, or rather...

19:26.420 --> 19:27.630
Shadow.

19:27.710 --> 19:30.960
Mitsugoshi is a front company for Shadow Garden.

19:31.750 --> 19:35.130
He has been pulling all the strings from the beginning.

19:35.710 --> 19:38.500
My apologies, but we collected
every one of the gold coins.

19:38.880 --> 19:43.880
And that is how Mitsugoshi will survive
the credit collapse, I presume?

19:44.170 --> 19:46.710
We have also taken over all of the MCA's outlets.

19:46.710 --> 19:49.080
Our position in the marketplace will soon be absolute.

19:49.290 --> 19:53.130
Mr. Shadow knew exactly
what would happen all along.

19:53.500 --> 19:56.380
If you wish to denounce him as a traitor,
you are welcome to do so.

19:56.540 --> 19:58.790
He is prepared to accept even that.

19:58.790 --> 20:00.830
I have no such intentions.

20:01.130 --> 20:03.960
We are prepared to welcome you into our ranks.

20:03.960 --> 20:07.960
Mitsugoshi as your front,
and myself as your underbelly.

20:08.170 --> 20:09.790
I expect that is your proposal?

20:12.250 --> 20:13.670
Thank you for joining us.

20:16.960 --> 20:18.750
I look forward to doing business with you.

20:31.250 --> 20:33.710
<i>I've been digging holes constantly ever since,</i>

20:33.710 --> 20:37.210
<i>and yet for some reason, I haven't found a thing.</i>

20:37.750 --> 20:40.000
<i>I was supposed to retrieve the gold coins
he entrusted to me</i>

20:39.630 --> 20:45.000
Futto ukabu shiroi iki
White breath rises with a puff<b></b>

20:40.000 --> 20:42.170
<i>and achieve my happy ending.</i>

20:42.630 --> 20:44.420
<i>And yet, for some reason,</i>

20:45.000 --> 20:46.380
<i>I haven't found a single gold coin.</i>

20:46.040 --> 20:50.960
Sutto tokete kieta
It quickly melted away<b></b>

20:46.380 --> 20:48.330
<i>I'm getting radio silence from Yukime,</i>

20:48.330 --> 20:50.630
<i>and Mitsugoshi continues to be doing just fine.</i>

20:50.960 --> 20:51.960
Boss!

20:52.380 --> 20:57.790
Sotto taguriyoseta no wa
What I quietly drew in<b></b>

20:52.380 --> 20:55.210
When we're done digging holes,
then will you do what I say?

20:55.210 --> 20:56.080
What?

20:56.080 --> 20:57.290
You promised.

20:57.290 --> 20:59.880
What? Did I make you a promise like that?

20:58.210 --> 21:02.290
Tooi kako ka yume ka?
Was it the distant past or a dream?<b></b>

20:59.880 --> 21:00.880
You did!

21:00.880 --> 21:03.210
No, but I didn't say I would do anything you say-

21:03.210 --> 21:04.420
Yes, you did!

21:04.830 --> 21:06.460
No, it had to be something I'm capable of.

21:05.130 --> 21:10.630
Tenohira ga mada sukoshi
My palms are still a little<b></b>

21:06.460 --> 21:07.790
You said you'd do it!

21:07.790 --> 21:09.670
Delta, you shouldn't lie.

21:09.670 --> 21:10.920
I never said that.

21:10.630 --> 21:17.130
Atsui you na sameta you na itai you na
Hot, and cold, and sore<b></b>

21:10.920 --> 21:14.710
If I had a voice recorder,
everyone would know that you are lying.

21:15.880 --> 21:17.540
Voice recorder?

21:17.540 --> 21:18.960
A Weapon of the Shadows.

21:17.630 --> 21:30.710
Nigirishimeteita yubisaki ga doko mo sasezu
The fingers I had been clenching are unable to point anywhere<b></b>

21:18.960 --> 21:21.330
If it were ever used,
it would bring about the end of the world.

21:22.130 --> 21:24.080
You don't want the world to end, do you?

21:24.080 --> 21:25.670
That's why you shouldn't lie.

21:25.670 --> 21:28.250
Ungh, I don't want the end of the world.

21:28.460 --> 21:30.380
But you did say it, Boss!

21:30.380 --> 21:33.380
All right, all right, then we can compromise.

21:33.040 --> 21:36.960
Miagereba
If I look up<b></b>

21:33.880 --> 21:35.290
I'll do what I can.

21:35.580 --> 21:38.040
But you know, Delta, I'm not Santa,

21:36.960 --> 21:45.920
Mujou ni furu yuki wa kisetsu o shiraseru dake
The heartlessly falling snow only informs me of the season<b></b>

21:38.040 --> 21:39.750
so I can't give you anything.

21:39.750 --> 21:41.080
Santa?

21:41.080 --> 21:42.500
Santa Claus:

21:42.500 --> 21:44.460
An evil, fiendish demon lord clad in red

21:44.460 --> 21:46.920
who descends upon the World of Shadows.

21:45.920 --> 21:55.830
Tsukamenai mama ni oikoshite yuku toki o
Now, I watched time pass me by<b></b>

21:46.920 --> 21:48.130
Demon lord!

21:49.080 --> 21:52.830
His suit is a deep blood red,
because he betrays people's dreams,

21:52.830 --> 21:56.080
grants them despair,
and uses that blood to dye his robes.

21:55.830 --> 22:03.920
Ima wa miokutta
Without letting me take hold of it<b></b>

21:56.080 --> 21:57.080
That's mean!

21:57.080 --> 21:59.080
It sure is. He's a mean guy.

21:59.080 --> 22:01.000
Even I suffered because of him.

22:01.000 --> 22:02.130
You, Boss?

22:02.130 --> 22:04.540
I had this dream that I really wanted to come true,

22:04.540 --> 22:06.040
and that's what I always asked him for,

22:06.040 --> 22:07.710
but he kept betraying my hopes.

22:07.710 --> 22:09.040
A dream?

22:09.040 --> 22:11.170
I wanted to be the Eminence in-

22:11.710 --> 22:12.880
No, never mind.

22:12.880 --> 22:16.330
I decided to never tell anyone
the things that really matter to me.

22:15.670 --> 22:21.920
Ano hi musunda chiisana yakusoku
When the ties come undone<b></b>

22:16.540 --> 22:19.380
Anyway, the point is, he betrayed me every single year,

22:19.380 --> 22:21.170
and it left terrible scars on my heart.

22:21.170 --> 22:23.420
And so, Delta, what I'm trying to say is,

22:21.920 --> 22:27.540
Musubime ga tokareru toki
On the little promise we made that day<b></b>

22:23.420 --> 22:26.960
I am not Santa, so I can't give you anything you want.

22:26.960 --> 22:29.420
But Santa doesn't give you anything you want.

22:27.540 --> 22:30.540
Kizuku no
Then I realize<b></b>

22:29.420 --> 22:31.000
He betrayed your dreams.

22:31.000 --> 22:32.210
What?

22:31.130 --> 22:35.630
Everything is changing

22:32.500 --> 22:33.710
What?

22:34.250 --> 22:35.670
We're not really on the same page, are we?

22:35.670 --> 22:36.880
Nope, we're not!

22:37.500 --> 22:40.000
Well, whatever, the important thing is, I will compromise,

22:37.960 --> 22:45.210
Mitsuzuketa yume no ato o
In the wake of the dream I dreamed for so long<b></b>

22:40.000 --> 22:41.960
but I can't give you anything.

22:43.290 --> 22:45.000
I'm about to set out on a journey,

22:45.000 --> 22:47.670
so think about what you want,
and then you can tell me when I get back.

22:45.210 --> 22:50.830
Subete tsuresari mau konayuki
The powdered snow dances, taking everything away<b></b>

22:47.670 --> 22:48.880
A journey?

22:49.630 --> 22:51.580
Just kind of a journey of self discovery.

22:50.830 --> 23:00.500
Chiribameta hikari tada mihoreteta toki o
There was a time I was just stunned by the twinkling lights<b></b>

22:52.460 --> 22:54.210
<i>They are definitely furious with me,</i>

22:54.210 --> 22:56.380
<i>so they're going to need a little time to cool off.</i>

22:56.830 --> 22:59.380
<i>Time is generally enough to solve any problem.</i>

22:59.380 --> 23:00.960
<i>I just have to come back nonchalantly,</i>

23:00.500 --> 23:04.830
Ima wa
Right now<b></b>

23:00.960 --> 23:02.830
<i>like, at the end of winter or something.</i>

23:03.330 --> 23:05.330
<i>When I do, I do not apologize.</i>

23:05.330 --> 23:07.330
<i>I just have to act like normal.</i>

23:05.380 --> 23:10.210
Shinjite itai
I want to believe in that time<b></b>

23:07.330 --> 23:10.210
<i>You see, I have discovered the secret technique</i>

23:10.330 --> 23:12.170
<i>to make sure I never lose at interpersonal relationships.</i>

23:12.170 --> 23:14.920
<i>And that is to exasperate them into giving up.</i>

23:15.170 --> 23:17.710
<i>A baby can mess up all it wants
and no one complains.</i>

23:17.710 --> 23:19.420
<i>It's pretty much something like that.</i>

23:19.580 --> 23:21.420
<i>But I tread very carefully.</i>

23:21.710 --> 23:22.920
<i>Why?</i>

23:22.920 --> 23:26.210
<i>Because, while I am the victor,
I am simultaneously the loser.</i>

23:35.540 --> 23:37.830
Boss! I found something!
